 with role `clean_room_implementer` and a judgment-free rule: compare `join_impl.py` vs `joiner.py` item-by-item over `probes.json`, set `divergent_probe_indices` to the sorted differing indices, `DIVERGES` iff non-empty.\n\nOne note: the `child-templates/` directory contained contract and harness templates (which I used verbatim, filling the placeholders) but no prompt template that I could locate by name with Read-only access, so `child-prompt.md` was authored from the protocol's specification of its required contents."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4300,"cache_read_input_tokens":55625,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4300},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db66dc51-f7c6-488d-b329-2a1d62a73761","uuid":"59d59987-bcc1-431a-8b24-736b7c88532f","timestamp":"2026-08-09T16:38:45.305Z","request_id":"req_011CdsWA4VLpwBdTp2JP9cCm"}
